Lola is the default window system in this tree.

It is compatible with the usual rio startup tools, so the window
command still creates new shell or program windows.  Lola also adds
title bars, window decoration styles, virtual desktops, window picking,
and experimental tabbed windows.

The mouse menus are mostly rio-like.  Button 3 on the desktop opens
the window menu; a 1-2 chord on the desktop opens the screen menu for
virtual desktops.

For more information, try the lola(1) manual page.
